  DialogueLines:
  - textVI: "H\xE3y t\xE1i sinh t\u1EEB \u0111\u1ED1ng tro t\xE0n. Ch\xFAng ta, mu\u1ED1n
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c s\u1ED1ng b\u1EB1ng b\u1EA5t c\u1EE9 gi\xE1 n\xE0o!"
    textEN: Rise from the ashes! We demand to live, no matter the cost!
    AutoSkip: 0
  - textVI: "Ch\xFAng ta c\xF3 th\u1EC3 s\u1EBD th\u1EA5t b\u1EA1i, nh\u01B0ng l\xFD
      t\u01B0\u1EDFng s\u1EBD kh\xF4ng bao gi\u1EDD b\u1ECB khu\u1EA5t ph\u1EE5c!"
    textEN: We may be defeated, but our ideals will never kneel!
    AutoSkip: 0
